runs only 0.4x depreciation (1.6% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is 10, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business.","It has beaten earnings estimates by 135.9% on average."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 3.2%, and institutions hold 99%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (8 sales, net $1.4M sold).","It returns 7.4% a year to shareholders (4.1% in buybacks and 3.3% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 3.3% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","It has paid a dividend for 22 consecutive years, raising it 11.0% a year over the last five.","Short interest is elevated at 14.8% of the float, 5.3 days to cover."],"people":["With about 90,134 employees, each generates about $251K of revenue, 0.7x the Consumer Cyclical median.","That works out to $12K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $4.8M (19x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better)."]},"profile":{"v":"INVEST","conv":82,"head":"Invest: trades 73% below fair value of $84.62; net debt/EBITDA 0.6x.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 45, gates 14/24)","Trades 73% below fair value of $84.62","Net debt/EBITDA 0.6x","Piotroski F-score 7/9","P/E 8.5x vs sector 19.3x"],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":71.93,"vc":{"base":84.62,"base_src":"dcf","bear":60.97,"bull":119.51,"alt_median":17.95,"n_alt":3,"gap":5.2272,"dispersion":0.3007,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (30% dispersion)","DCF is 523% above the other models' median ($17.95)"]},"med":{"pe":19.2575,"ev_ebitda":11.198,"pfcf":16.4664,"pb":2.375,"roic":0.1281,"gross_margin":0.3475,"fcf_margin":0.0624,"div_yield":0.0228}},"ticker":"M","date":"2026-11-06"}